<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>glitchr/omnibase — every plugin</title>
    <style>
        body { font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 60rem; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; } h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
        section { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding: .8rem 0; }
        .about { color: #666; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
        pre { background: #f6f6f6; padding: .6rem .8rem; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .ok::before { content: "[OK] "; color: #060; }
        .error::before { content: "[FAILED] "; color: #a00; }
        .go { display: inline-block; margin: .5rem .5rem .5rem 0; padding: .5rem 1rem; background: #006699; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>glitchr/omnibase, with every plugin</h1>
    <p>One application running the base bundle and all of omnibase/*: the back office, the shop, the forge, the forum, the mailbox, the docs. This page seeds two members and a shop, signs you in as Marki (an admin), and checks the wiring; the plugins themselves are the links.</p>

    {% for label, url in {'Shop': '/boutiques', 'Forum': '/bbs', 'Mailbox': '/messagerie', 'Support hours': '/support', 'Licences': '/compte/licences', 'Repositories': '/git', 'Back office': '/admin'} %}
    <a class="go" href="{{ url }}">{{ label }} →</a>
    {% endfor %}
    <p><a href="{{ path('demo_switch', {username: app.user and app.user.username == 'Marki' ? 'Chimbo' : 'Marki'}) }}">Switch to {{ app.user and app.user.username == 'Marki' ? 'Chimbo' : 'Marki' }}</a> (the other member: write to them, answer them).</p>

    {% for section in sections %}
    <section>
        <h2 class="{{ section.ok ? 'ok' : 'error' }}">{{ section.title }}</h2>
        <p class="about">{{ section.about }}</p>
        <pre>{{ section.output }}</pre>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
</body>
</html>
